From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sunu Aziz Rahayu <sunuazizrahayu@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 26 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] base: disable TrebleDroid charger images clashing with Lineage

device/phh/treble/charger/Android.mk mendaftarkan prebuilt charger
images untuk path yang sama dengan modul Soong lineage_charger_*,
sehingga kati abort "overriding commands". File itu menghormati
LOCAL_CHARGER_NO_UI, jadi set di sini (product config selalu dibaca
sebelum file Android.mk dievaluasi, jadi tidak ada isu urutan).

(Port dari 23.2-backup2; pendekatan berlawanan dari percobaan
menghapus charger Lineage yang terbukti tidak berpengaruh.)
---
 base.mk | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/base.mk b/base.mk
index 0000000..0000000 100644
--- a/base.mk
+++ b/base.mk
@@ -50,6 +50,10 @@ PRODUCT_COPY_FILES += \
 PRODUCT_COPY_FILES += \
     device/phh/treble/charger.rc:system/etc/init/charger.rc

+# Lineage charger images cover these paths; disable TrebleDroid prebuilt
+# image rules that would clash with them (kati "overriding commands").
+LOCAL_CHARGER_NO_UI := true
+
 # USB Audio
 PRODUCT_COPY_FILES += \
     frameworks/av/services/audiopolicy/config/usb_audio_policy_configuration.xml:system/etc/usb_audio_policy_configuration.xml \
--
2.54.0
